"│         │ <Space>?  help.keys             Open the key cheat sheet                     │         │"
"│         │ <C-c>     modal.close_all       Close every open modal                       │         │"
"│         │ j         modal.scroll_down     Scroll the top modal down                    │         │"
"│         │ k         modal.scroll_up       Scroll the top modal up                      │         │"
"│         │ <Esc>     modal.close           Close the top modal                          │         │"
